            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "Selling price",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "\nDetails: "
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "During the public test period, only the review fee for plugin developers (varies with the number of pieces counted from the content of the distribution using a public measurement method; the tax-inclusive amount and a breakdown of its calculation are shown on the application screen). In the official version, each point pack shows the total payment in yen and the confirmed tax treatment, and each feature shows the number of points required and the tax-inclusive yen equivalent. Free portions are distinguished"
            }
          ],
          "pad": 16
        }
