              "s": "text",
              "text": "【TBD: 30 days】",
              "bold": true,
              "code": true
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": " of the start (estimates; each date is shown on the application screen, and if a delay is expected, notice is given before the estimated date). Points: "
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "【normal time required】",
              "bold": true,
              "code": true
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": " after payment and grant are confirmed. How to check and make inquiries in case of delay is also shown"
