            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "\nDetails: "
            },
            {
              "s": "text",
              "text": "Review fees: Article 4-2 of the Plugin Store and Developer Terms (no refund merely for a return for revision or a rejection; full refund for cancellation before review begins, cancellation when review has not begun after the estimated start date has passed, cancellation when the result has not been notified after the estimated notification date has passed, erroneous charges, and rejection or return for revision due to the Operator's error). Points and features: Articles 5 and 6 above. Handling of the user's own convenience / defects / non-delivery, and the contact points for each, are distinguished"
